    "detailed_description": "Welcome to \u201cKeep it Shut\u201d \u2014 a first-person horror game.<br />\r\nImagine finding yourself in a sinister forest where every rustle sounds like a harbinger of danger, and the shadows seem full of hidden malice. <br />\r\n\u201cKeep it Shut\u201d is not just a game; it\u2019s a truly immersive experience that makes your heart race and sends chills down your spine!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFrom the very first moment, you are enveloped in an atmosphere filled with eerie sounds and stunning graphics that draw you into a world of anxiety and darkness. <br />\r\nThe forest, teeming with mysterious monsters, becomes the stage for your boldest adventures. <br />\r\nYou will explore its uncharted corners, where every decision you make could be crucial!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCreepy atmosphere<br />\r\nMonsters in the woods<br />\r\nNote collection<br />\r\nImmersive graphics<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cKeep it Shut\u201d offers a unique experience full of thrills, dangers, and mysteries. <br />\r\nIf you\u2019re ready to face your fears and explore this eerie forest, then dive into this hardcore horror world!<br />\r\nUncover the secrets, stay alert, and maybe you will survive!",
